      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard shows",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Jupiter — Savings long-term** reads the **long-term ledger** (PostgreSQL `jupiter-pg`, jupiter ADR-0030 / card #308): one `daily_savings` row per site-day with the full ADR-0005 result, frozen at local midnight, plus the month's capacity peak. Every number is **net-battery accounting** (SoC-delta flows, ADR-0024 §5). Rows tagged `zeus_daily` (pre-2026-07-06) carry EUR only — their kWh / cost columns are empty by design. The **open day** (today, `final = false`) still moves with the reporting-service's refresh."
      }
    },
